### 결제 요청
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{login-id}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{login-pw}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "VISA",
  "cardNo": "4111111111111111"
}

### 결제 상세 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{login-id}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{login-pw}}

### 결제 상태 동기화 (수동)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1/sync
X-Loopers-LoginId: {{login-id}}
X-Loopers-LoginPw: {{login-pw}}

### PG 콜백 - 결제 성공
POST {{commerce-api}}/internal/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "txn-12345",
  "status": "SUCCESS"
}

### PG 콜백 - 결제 실패
POST {{commerce-api}}/internal/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "txn-12345",
  "status": "FAILED",
  "reason": "잔액 부족"
}
